<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1" /><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans-CN"><text for="L1">这毋庸置疑</text><text for="L2">我能看出你在竭力表演</text><text for="L3">而她痴迷上瘾</text><text for="L4">满心觉得我定能治愈他</text><text for="L5">她眼中满是爱心</text><text for="L6">描摹我亲吻其他男孩的场景</text><text for="L7">她的爱就是这种类型</text><text for="L8">根本不知该在何处划清界限</text><text for="L9">啦啦队女孩</text><text for="L10">本以为她需要我没想到却是我需要她<span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(宝贝你告诉我你在歌唱)</span></text><text for="L11">这不公平</text><text for="L12">因为我对你犹如手心手背般了如指掌</text><text for="L13">难道你毫不在乎吗我已交出我的一切</text><text for="L14">如今即便你不在身边我也能感受到你的存在</text><text for="L15">莫名感到有些感伤</text><text for="L16">置身疯狂之中又不是你的错</text><text for="L17">可我不能就此退缩</text><text for="L18">难道你没厌倦被迫融入背景当个透明人吗</text><text for="L19">她眼中满是爱心</text><text for="L20">嘴里说着男孩你最好留意时间</text><text for="L21">因为如果你不属于我</text><text for="L22">我宁愿看你被烈焰活活吞噬</text><text for="L23">啦啦队女孩</text><text for="L24">说她恨透了我只因我不属于她<span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(宝贝你告诉我你在歌唱)</span></text><text for="L25">这不公平</text><text for="L26">因为我对你犹如手心手背般了如指掌</text><text for="L27">难道你毫不在乎吗我已交出我的一切</text><text for="L28">如今即便你不在身边我也能感受到你的存在</text><text for="L29">不知为何我甚至不清楚她现在过得怎样</text><text for="L30">我究竟是祝她安好还是切切实实地思念她</text><text for="L31">她眼中满是爱心无时无刻不在为我加油打气</text><text for="L32">像她那样的爱会让你想要为之奉献终生</text><text for="L33">噢我的啦啦队女孩</text><text for="L34">本以为她需要我没想到却是我需要她</text><text for="L35">这不公平</text><text for="L36">因为我对你犹如手心手背般了如指掌</text><text for="L37">难道你毫不在乎吗我已交出我的一切</text><text for="L38">如今即便你不在身边我也能感受到你的存在</text><text for="L39">是的即便你不在身边我也能感受到你的存在</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:31.193"><div begin="15.920" end="42.299" itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="15.920" end="16.919" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.920" end="16.112">There's</span> <span begin="16.112" end="16.512">no</span> <span begin="16.512" end="16.919">doubt</span></p><p begin="17.560" end="20.181" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.560" end="17.911">I</span> <span begin="17.911" end="18.100">can</span> <span begin="18.100" end="18.312">tell</span> <span begin="18.312" end="18.553">you're</span> <span begin="18.553" end="18.820">act</span><span begin="18.820" end="19.160">ing</span> <span begin="19.160" end="19.360">your</span> <span begin="19.360" end="19.731">heart</span> <span begin="19.731" end="20.181">out</span></p><p begin="21.940" end="23.430" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.940" end="22.132">And</span> <span begin="22.132" end="22.329">she's</span> <span begin="22.329" end="22.558">ad</span><span begin="22.558" end="23.000">dict</span><span begin="23.000" end="23.430">ed</span></p><p begin="23.647" end="29.806" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.647" end="23.862">Ob</span><span begin="23.862" end="24.419">sessed,</span> <span begin="24.419" end="24.840">like,</span> <span begin="24.840" end="25.052">"I</span> <span begin="25.052" end="25.342">know</span> <span begin="25.342" end="25.618">I</span> <span begin="25.618" end="25.861">can</span> <span begin="25.861" end="27.211">fix</span> <span begin="27.211" end="27.751">him</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="27.470" end="28.068">(Oh-</span><span begin="28.068" end="28.988">oh-</span><span begin="28.988" end="29.806">oh)</span></span></p><p begin="28.413" end="31.431" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.413" end="28.630">She's</span> <span begin="28.630" end="29.031">got</span> <span begin="29.031" end="30.042">hearts</span> <span begin="30.042" end="30.293">in</span> <span begin="30.293" end="30.510">her</span> <span begin="30.510" end="31.431">eyes</span></p><p begin="31.704" end="34.939" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.704" end="31.913">And</span> <span begin="31.913" end="32.122">she</span> <span begin="32.122" end="32.510">draws</span> <span begin="32.510" end="32.734">me</span> <span begin="32.734" end="32.964">kiss</span><span begin="32.964" end="33.142">ing</span> <span begin="33.142" end="33.562">oth</span><span begin="33.562" end="33.773">er</span> <span begin="33.773" end="34.939">guys</span></p><p begin="34.939" end="37.758" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.939" end="35.310">Her</span> <span begin="35.310" end="35.952">love,</span> <span begin="36.573" end="36.979">the</span> <span begin="36.979" end="37.758">type</span></p><p begin="38.320" end="40.677" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.320" end="38.500">Where</span> <span begin="38.500" end="38.671">she</span> <span begin="38.671" end="39.020">don't</span> <span begin="39.020" end="39.240">know</span> <span begin="39.240" end="39.441">where</span> <span begin="39.441" end="39.641">to</span> <span begin="39.641" end="40.070">draw</span> <span begin="40.070" end="40.291">the</span> <span begin="40.291" end="40.677">line</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="41.072" end="41.459">(Oh-</span><span begin="41.459" end="41.673">oh-</span><span begin="41.673" end="42.299">oh)</span></span></p></div><div begin="42.012" end="54.271" itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="42.012" end="46.668" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.012" end="43.472">Cheer</span><span begin="43.472" end="46.668">leader</span></p><p begin="46.668" end="53.647" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.668" end="47.081">Thought</span> <span begin="47.081" end="47.482">she</span> <span begin="47.482" end="47.921">need</span><span begin="47.921" end="48.161">ed</span> <span begin="48.161" end="48.350">me,</span> <span begin="48.350" end="48.562">but</span> <span begin="48.562" end="49.950">I</span> <span begin="49.950" end="51.529">need</span> <span begin="51.529" end="53.647">her</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="52.414" end="52.594">(Oh</span> <span begin="52.594" end="52.961">baby,</span> <span begin="52.961" end="53.182">you</span> <span begin="53.182" end="53.444">tell</span> <span begin="53.444" end="53.714">me,</span> <span begin="53.714" end="53.962">you're</span> <span begin="53.962" end="54.271">singing)</span></span></p></div><div begin="54.452" end="1:15.950" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="54.452" end="59.075" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.452" end="54.614">It's</span> <span begin="54.614" end="54.934">not</span> <span begin="54.934" end="59.075">fair</span></p><p begin="59.287" end="1:02.717" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.287" end="59.467">'Cause</span> <span begin="59.467" end="59.655">I</span> <span begin="59.655" end="1:00.045">knew</span> <span begin="1:00.045" end="1:00.265">you</span> <span begin="1:00.265" end="1:00.453">like</span> <span begin="1:00.453" end="1:00.677">the</span> <span begin="1:00.677" end="1:00.854">back</span> <span begin="1:00.854" end="1:01.095">of</span> <span begin="1:01.095" end="1:01.764">my</span> <span begin="1:01.876" end="1:02.717">hands</span></p><p begin="1:06.884" end="1:11.849" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.884" end="1:07.334">Don't</span> <span begin="1:07.334" end="1:07.973">you</span> <span begin="1:07.973" end="1:10.033">care?</span> <span begin="1:10.188" end="1:10.307">I</span> <span begin="1:10.307" end="1:10.609">gave</span> <span begin="1:10.609" end="1:11.039">you</span> <span begin="1:11.039" end="1:11.454">every</span><span begin="1:11.454" end="1:11.849">thing</span></p><p begin="1:12.269" end="1:15.950" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.269" end="1:12.449">Now</span> <span begin="1:12.449" end="1:12.670">I</span> <span begin="1:12.670" end="1:13.050">feel</span> <span begin="1:13.050" end="1:13.271">you